# ==============================================================================
# ProspectPilot Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# The system runs 100% offline with zero external network access using:
#     python -m prospectpilot.cli --mock
#     pytest

# If you want to connect a live LLM provider, pick ONE of the verified options below.
# Note: Providers require specific models that support function/tool calling.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 1: OpenAI (Most reliable commercial tool-calling)
# Pricing: ~1/30th of a cent per run with gpt-4o-mini ($0.15 / 1M input tokens)
# Requires: Active OpenAI developer account with credit balance.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 2: Groq Cloud (Free Developer Tier - Zero Cost)
# Sign up: https://console.groq.com/keys (Free account, no credit card required)
# Verified Tool-Calling Model: llama-3.3-70b-versatile or llama-3.1-8b-instant
# (Caution: Some Groq models like deepseek-r1 do NOT support tool calling)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 3: Google Gemini via AI Studio (Free Tier Available)
# Sign up: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey (Free tier rate limits apply)
# Verified Model: gemini-1.5-flash
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 4: OpenRouter (Multi-model aggregator)
# Sign up: https://openrouter.ai/keys (Prepaid deposit required for paid models)
# Verified Tool-Calling Model: openai/gpt-4o-mini or meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 5: Local Ollama (100% Local, 100% Free, No API Keys)
# Requires: Ollama daemon installed locally (https://ollama.ai)
# Setup: ollama run llama3.1
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=ollama
# PROSPECTPILOT_MODEL=llama3.1
